<title>INDIA: India's Ranbaxy sees strong 97/98 sales.</title>
<headline>India's Ranbaxy sees strong 97/98 sales.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Ranbaxy Laboratories Ltd expects sales to grow by at least 20 percent in 1997/98 (April-March), president Davinder Singh Brar said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
